# Files that control CI, agents and what every spoke runs need a person's
# review (CCR security re-sweep 2026-11-26, M2). Agent sessions open PRs under
# the owner's login, and GitHub does not count an author's own review, so these
# paths name the separate human reviewer account, as OCR-docs does.
# Binds only when "Require review from Code Owners" is on for main.
/.github/               @mzdano
/.claude/               @mzdano
/CLAUDE.md              @mzdano
/scripts/               @mzdano
# Run inside every spoke's CI (the design check), so a change here changes
# their gates.
/packages/ui/scripts/   @mzdano
# Colours change only through CHANGING-COLORS.md (CLAUDE.md).
/packages/tokens/       @mzdano
